## Entity Structure
- id: string (e.g., "diverge_data", "organize_data", "converge_data")
- type: string ("concern" | "section_data")
- attributes: Array of Attribute objects

## Attribute Types (structuralType)
- SVAL: Scalar value (string, number, boolean)
- ARRY: Array
